# Go Standard Library Worker

Follow `.agents/skills/go-worker/SKILL.md` for runner, processor, config, and shutdown.

Hard rules:

- Stdlib only by default — no HTTP frameworks, queues, or cron libraries unless asked
- Implement work in `Processor`; keep `Runner` free of business side effects
- Use `context` cancellation + configurable shutdown timeout
- Do not overlap processing ticks
- Prefer `go test ./...` before claiming done
- Inspect existing packages before adding duplicates
